---

<section class="active-passive">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Passive Capital. <span class="highlight">Active Alignment Welcome.</span></h2>

    <div class="options-grid">
      <div class="option-card">
        <div class="option-label">Passive</div>
        <h3>Capital Allocation</h3>
        <p>Invest and let the Ancestro team execute. Receive regular updates, reports, and participate in the upside as the platform scales globally.</p>
        <ul class="option-features">
          <li>Quarterly investor updates</li>
          <li>Access to investor dashboard</li>
          <li>SAFE agreement protection</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="option-card active">
        <div class="option-label">Active</div>
        <h3>Strategic Partnership</h3>
        <p>Beyond capital — contribute your network, expertise, or distribution capabilities. Active investors receive deeper access and accelerated alignment.</p>
        <ul class="option-features">
          <li>Advisory opportunities</li>
          <li>Network introductions</li>
          <li>Co-development pathways</li>
          <li>Early access to new verticals</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="final-cta">
      <a href="#buy-stock" class="cta-primary">
        Buy Ancestro Stock
      </a>
      <p class="contact-line">
        Questions? Reach us at <a href="mailto:invest@ancestro.com" class="email-link">invest@ancestro.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .active-passive {
    padding: 100px 24px 120px;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-white);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .options-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .option-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 40px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .option-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  }

  .option-card.active {
    border-color: rgba(248,176,59,0.25);
    background: rgba(248,176,59,0.03);
  }

  .option-card.active:hover {
    border-color: rgba(248,176,59,0.4);
  }

  .option-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .option-card.active .option-label {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .option-card h3 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-white);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .option-card p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .option-features {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .option-features li {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .option-features li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 7px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
  }

  .option-card.active .option-features li::before {
    background: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .final-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 16px 48px;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-black);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .cta-primary:hover {
    background: #ffbe4d;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(248,176,59,0.35);
  }

  .contact-line {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }

  .email-link {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .email-link:hover {
    color: #ffbe4d;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .active-passive {
      padding: 60px 20px 80px;
    }

    .options-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .option-card {
      padding: 28px 24px;
    }

    .cta-primary {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
